        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b> Heavy Duty Rim Latchbolt, YAL-112</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nYale's heavy duty rim latchbolt provides high security surface mounted deadlock protection for doors 1-1/4\" to 2-1/4\" thick.  180º turn of the thumbturn throws or retracts deadbolt.  Available in sprayed brass finish only and supplied with matching mounting screws. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Yale Rim Latchbolt, YAL-112\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Body Width: 3-1-2\"</li>\r\n<li>Body Height: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Body Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Length:  1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Fixed Backset:  2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness:  1-1/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder:  brass 5 pin with anti-pick mushroom drivers</li>\r\n<li>Material:  Zinc Alloy</li></ul>\r\n</p>",
